  message: "Fixed in PR #3870 (ed6618908a). Both py.py call sites now use read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'); the utf-8-sig codec silently strips leading BOM. End-to-end verified: BOM-prefixed .py file now produces 1 function-kind Symbol with failed_files=[]. Two regression tests pin the invariant (one for the main analyzer path, one for the cross-file FastAPI prefix resolver). Companion INV-buhur (failed_files never populated by Python analyzer) remains open."  # 2251
